From 72fbba3d20f4616d7312b5e2b7f79daf6e82f2fa Fri Mar 13 11:11:00 2026
From: Valentyna Khomits <vkhomits@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 13 Mar 2026 11:11:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Create protobuf systemlib patch for TensorFlow

Creates protobuf_systemlib.patch that gets applied to the TensorFlow source
during Bazel build, replacing the vendored protobuf download with a repo
built from conda's protobuf-bazel-rules package (jaxlib-style), plus the
systemlib BUILD/bzl files for protobuf, grpc and python rules, and the
.bazelrc changes (drop -Werror=unused-result on linux for protobuf 7
nodiscard warnings).
Regenerated against TensorFlow 2.21.0.
---
 third_party/tensorflow/BUILD                    |    2 +-
 third_party/tensorflow/protobuf_systemlib.patch | 1691 +++++++++++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 1692 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

